    CreateRouteServerRequest.add_member(:persist_routes_duration, Smithy::Schema::Shapes::ShapeRef.new(shape: BoxedLong, location_name: 'PersistRoutesDuration', traits: {"smithy.api#documentation" => "<p>The number of minutes a route server will wait after BGP is re-established to unpersist the routes in the FIB and RIB. Value must be in the range of 1-5. Required if PersistRoutes is <code>enabled</code>.</p>\n         <p>If you set the duration to 1 minute, then when your network appliance re-establishes BGP with route server, it has 1 minute to relearn it's adjacent network and advertise those routes to route server before route server resumes normal functionality. In most cases, 1 minute is probably sufficient. If, however, you have concerns that your BGP network may not be capable of fully re-establishing and re-learning everything in 1 minute, you can increase the duration up to 5 minutes.</p>"}))
